  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "客户端链",
      "items": [
        "McpGateway 是单例门面：listTools 走 McpGatewayToolRegistry 聚合多 server 工具；callTool 按 serverId 路由",
        "McpGatewayClientFactory 复用 McpClient 连接；McpTransportFactory 按 TransportConfig 选 Stdio/SSE/StreamableHttp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "三种传输",
      "items": [
        "StdioTransport：拉起本地子进程走 stdin/stdout；SseTransport：SSE 读 + POST 写",
        "StreamableHttpTransport：单端点双向流式（新版推荐）；McpProtocolProfile 记录协议版本协商"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "服务端链与鉴权",
      "items": [
        "@McpService 标注的类经 McpServerFactory 装配成 Server 引擎；StdioMcpServer 供本机、Sse/StreamableHttp 供远端",
        "McpServerSessionSupport 管理会话态；BearerTokenAuthProvider 在 HTTP 引擎前校验 Bearer token"
      ]
    }
  ]
